ection></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请条件</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康，未受过任何处分；</span></p><p><span>2.学科专业不限，对公共管理领域的科学研究有较浓厚的兴趣，有较好的科研潜力和团队协作精神；</span></p><p><span>3.</span><strong><span>在校大三本科生（2027届应届本科毕业生）</span></strong><span>，学习成绩优异，报名时成绩排名为</span><strong><span>本专业前20%</span></strong><span>。（注：</span><strong><span>在科研、竞赛等方面有优异表现者，可适当放宽条件</span></strong><span>。）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请流程</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.系统报名时间：</span><strong><span>2026年6月1日8:00-2026年6月23日24:00点</span></strong><span>，逾期系统关闭，学院将不再受理。</span></p><p><span>2.申请人登录</span><strong><span>“西安交通大学夏令营报名系统”（</span><span><span>http://yzbm.</span></span></strong><strong><span>xjtu.</span></strong><strong><span>edu.</span></strong><strong><span>c</span></strong><strong><span>n/）</span></strong><span><span>，报名项目选择</span></span><strong><span>“全国优秀大学生夏令营”</span></strong><span><span>，注册获取报名号，用报名号重新登录后，阅读公管学院夏令营通知及相关规定，填写报名信息，上传报名材料后保存、提交。</span></span></p><p><span>3.上传材料：在报名系统上传申请材料的扫描件（材料</span><strong><span>按照清单顺序</span></strong><span>以</span><strong><span>PDF格式</span></strong><span>压缩为一个文件后上传，命名格式为</span><strong><span>姓名+本科所在学校</span></strong><span>）。</span></p><p><span>1）</span><strong><span>西安交通大学2026年优秀大学生夏令营申请表（系统生成）</span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><span>2）</span><strong><span>截止目前本科阶段成绩单1份（加盖学校或者院系教务部门公章）</span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><span>3）</span><strong><span>英语水平证明</span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><span>4）</span><strong><span>其他材料1份，包括：获奖证书，发表或者能体现自身学术水平的学术论文、出版物等</span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><span>5）</span><strong><span>身份证扫描件（正反）</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>4.审核确认：夏令营全部审核工作将在</span><strong><span>6月26日前</span></strong><span>结束。请在报名系统</span><strong><span>“审核状态查询”</span></strong><span>中查看审核结果，并于</span><strong><span>6月29日24:00前</span></strong><strong><span>确认是否参营</span></strong><span>，逾期未确认者视为放弃参加夏令营。确认参营的同学，请及时关注邮件通知。</span><strong><span>暂未通过审核的同学审核状态不改变，如后期有补录，将会通知到个人。</span></strong></p><p><span>特别说明：</span><strong><span>系统报名，无需邮寄纸质材料。</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>注意事项</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.入选营员要求全程参加夏令营活动，严格遵守夏令营的要求与纪律，按时参加活动，无故缺席者将被立即取消参营资格。</span></p><p><span>2.若发现申请材料弄虚作假，取消或追回申请人由此获得的一切权益，学院保留追诉的权利。</span></p><p><span>3.本次活动将通过综合考核选拔优秀营员。</span></p><p><span>4.未能参加夏令营的同学后期可关注学院的推免生招生活动。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>05</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.入选营员要求全程参加夏令营活动，严格遵守夏令营的要求与纪律，按时参加活动，无故缺席者将被立即取消参营资格。</span></p><p><span>2.若发现申请材料弄虚作假，取消或追回申请人由此获得的一切权益，学院保留追诉的权利。</span></p><p><span>3.本次活动将通过综合考核选拔优秀营员。</span></p><p><span>4.未能参加夏令营的同学后期可关注学院的推免生招生活动。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>公共政策与管理学院</span></p><p><span>2026年5月20日</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/gjAat9eicibYmQicc7wc3HGHnlyIzDjXlgOcV0J9WkeTTp5lp52g0dGVTK0QKotxqVAokap1esMnyt9v1cqhX1Vz9SImhjR3c2lR5nFhcNCGfk/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>欢</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>迎</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>关</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>注</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img 